#NEXUS

[ yu2018a_fig4: Panel a, read by eye at 2x. Each black triangle is a collapsed clade and is one tip, named by the word under it. Polytomies: Zuolong-Tugulusaurus-Tyrannosauroidea-the rest, Therizinosauroidea-Alvaresauroidea-the rest, and a six-way node (Epidexipteryx, Pedopenna, the Anomalopes clade, Troodontidae, Dromaeosauridae, Avialae). 18 tips, 3 polytomies (4, 3, 6 children). Sample 6 case (census 2 extended to draw 120, seed 20261231). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

